  "verify": "Pins from Waveshare's demo code and schematic (https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.75C). 1) Flash size. The schematic draws U2 as XM25QH128DHIQT, a 128 Mbit (16 MB) part. The docs page, the product page, every sdkconfig.defaults (CONFIG_ESPTOOLPY_FLASHSIZE_32MB) and the factory image in the repository (33,488,896 bytes, which cannot fit 16 MB) say 32 MB. Believed the code and the image: 32 MB; the schematic's part name looks carried over from the 1.75. On the board and not in this preset: 16 MB of its 32 MB flash: the export builds for 16 MB. Brightness is a command to the panel, not a backlight pin. Compiled; not run on a board here.",
